      "name": "tie-utf8-not-utf16",
      "pills": [
        {
          "emoji": "☝🏻",
          "count": 1,
          "boostTotal": 0
        },
        {
          "emoji": "☝️",
          "count": 1,
          "boostTotal": 0
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        "☝️",
        "☝🏻"
      ],
      "note": "The case that separates byte order from a platform's default string compare. Both start U+261D. Next, ☝️ has U+FE0F (UTF-8 EF B8 8F) and ☝🏻 has U+1F3FB (F0 9F 8F BB): EF < F0 in UTF-8, but in UTF-16 the surrogate D83C < FE0F, which would flip them."
    }
